// Repro — under the tss/p37-registry branch (registry retirement), the
// SPECIALIZATION of a generic impl method whose def-time trial legitimately
// swallowed never re-evaluates: the emitted body is the abort stub.
//
//   yo check issues/repros/array-fill-spec-stays-hollow-under-p37.yo
//   yo: FATAL: reached fn_yo_id_17076690078229831711000000, whose body failed
//       to transpile - its definition-time evaluation failed and was swallowed.
//
// Green on develop (the spec re-check types fill(i32, 4) concretely). The
// failure surface is order-dependent per binary; see
// issues/p37-registry-retirement-blocked-by-codegen-readers.md.
{ println } :: import("std/fmt");
main :: (fn() -> unit)({
  arr := Array(i32, 4).fill(i32(7));
  println(arr(usize(0)).to_string());
});
export(main);
